## Erlang VM configuration for demo_web
##
## For clustering, ensure RELEASE_NODE and RELEASE_COOKIE are set
## See rel/env.sh.eex for environment setup

## Name of the node - set via RELEASE_NODE env var in docker-compose
## -name is not set here to allow env var override

## Cookie for distributed erlang - set via RELEASE_COOKIE env var
## -setcookie is not set here to allow env var override

## Enable kernel poll for improved performance
+K true

## Max async thread pool size (default: 1, increase for I/O heavy workloads)
+A 32

## Scheduler bind type (sb = spread, db = bind with process balancing)
+sbt db

## Enable heartbeat for monitored releases
-heart

## Increase port limit for many connections
+Q 65536

## Enable SMP (symmetric multi-processing)
-smp auto

## Kernel inet_dist configuration (set via env.sh.eex)
## -kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100 inet_dist_listen_max 9105
